OL,3,AFroyo's made a comeback. But at #12 a
OL,4,Atub will it last?
OL,5,
OL,6,FKiersten Paterno was one of the many
OL,7,Fpeople willing to queue up to an hour
OL,8,Fto treat herself to some frozen
OL,9,Fyoghurt.
OL,11,F"It was a 45-minute wait for my turn
OL,12,Fbut the whole experience of choosing
OL,13,Fyour flavours and customising it with
OL,14,Fdifferent toppings was a big part of
OL,15,Fthe appeal for me," the 19-year-old
OL,16,Fstudent says.
OL,18,FFroyo was a huge trend in the UK in the
OL,19,Flate 2000s and early 2010s and was most
OL,20,Fpopular in London.
